# Week 4 - Azure Data Factory Pipeline Project

## Objective
Implement an end-to-end data pipeline using Azure Storage Account, Blob Container, and Azure Data Factory.

## Tasks Performed

1. Created Azure Resource Group
2. Created Storage Account
3. Created Blob Container
4. Uploaded Superstore CSV dataset
5. Created Azure Data Factory
6. Configured Linked Services
7. Created Source and Sink Datasets
8. Built Copy Data Pipeline
9. Executed and Monitored Pipeline
10. Validated Data Movement

## Dataset
Superstore Dataset (Kaggle)

## Tools Used
- Microsoft Azure
- Azure Storage Account
- Azure Blob Storage
- Azure Data Factory

